    "0a241f58-774b-4dc9-b402-ebb3e6193972": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "template--17607372964115__0a241f58-774b-4dc9-b402-ebb3e6193972-16739655325d1e4dcf-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is Monthlies?",
            "row_content": "<p>We’re a team of women who believe that painkillers are not your only way to ease your menstrual pain. Based on data and expertise we’ve created the Relief & Balance Ritual to support you in any phase of your cycle on short and longer term. </p><p>Our offer includes your personally recommended and expertly curated products, your personal cycle report in which we guide you in when to do what, lifestyle tips and a free consultation with one of our experts after 30 days of trying Monthlies.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--17607372964115__0a241f58-774b-4dc9-b402-ebb3e6193972-16739655325d1e4dcf-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I get my recommendations?",
            "row_content": "<p>Tell us about your symptoms in our online cycle assessment. Based on your answers, we’ll recommend your very own personalised Monthlies Relief & Balance Ritual right away. With every order you receive a cycle report on how to put these recommendations into practice.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--17607372964115__0a241f58-774b-4dc9-b402-ebb3e6193972-16739655325d1e4dcf-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are the recommendations free of charge?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! You get your recommendations absolutely for free after you take your cycle assessment. You can choose to have your recommendations emailed to you as well. If you decide to buy any of our recommendations you can buy them at a fair price.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--17607372964115__0a241f58-774b-4dc9-b402-ebb3e6193972-16739655325d1e4dcf-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does the data driven recommendation system work?",
            "row_content": "<p>We made our cycle assessment based on data from real women in combination with years of expertise of our team and experts in the field. Depending on your individual answers to our cycle assessment, our data driven system creates a tailored bundle for your specific needs. Our experts create your personal guidance report.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "4ec00491-ea6f-46c6-94d7-796101532d77": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does it take until I get my recommendation?",
            "row_content": "<p>The cycle assessment takes about 7 minutes. You will receive your personalised recommendations right away. You can choose to have them emailed to you and you will receive your personalised link.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "31941e98-75d9-4812-bfd6-fe1ec1a118de": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I buy the recommended products directly?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. To start we recommend a personally curated Relief & Balance ritual to set your baseline. On top of that you can buy our proposed products to suit your lifestyle. Our guidance report, that comes with your ritual, includes details on the benefits and use of each product to get you to a better cycle.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "9d60fd2b-0408-4be6-8837-23a723f9e07d": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is Monthlies a subscription?",
            "row_content": "<p>No, although we do include a consultation with one of our experts after one month to see how we can help you on a longer term.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "bf845a6b-ed70-4981-b487-257c64793082": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How much does Monthlies cost?",
            "row_content": "<p>Our recommendations are free. Your personal Relief & Balance ritual will include products to set your new baseline. It includes a set of 5 products tailored to your need. This will be a combination of supplements, teas, and the latest innovations in cycle care. On top of that, you're invited to a 15-minute consultation with one of our doctors after your first month. All of this is currently priced at 60 EUR. We’re offering a discount on your first purchase when you reach the recommendations, go take your cycle assessment!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "208c5a73-ee97-4d80-9369-a861c1222982": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does it take to receive my order?",
            "row_content": "<p>We ship in the first week of March 2023, shipping can take up to 10 days.</p><p><em>If you have any question, you can write to us at info@monthlies.com</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
